{"data": {"allowed_tools": ["bash", "edit_file", "glob", "grep", "read_file", "write_file"], "auxiliary_agents": false, "context_compression": true, "hooks": "frozen-empty", "instructions": "只操作当前任务目录，不修改运行时安装，不提交 Git。使用任务项目 Python。", "memory": "empty", "mode": "default", "permissions": {"allow": ["Write", "Edit", "Bash"], "deny": []}, "progressive_tool_schema": true, "registered_tools": [{"description": "读取指定路径的文件内容，返回带行号的文本。文件不存在或不可读时返回结构化错误。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["path"], "type": "object"}, "name": "read_file"}, {"description": "将内容写入指定路径的文件（覆盖写）。父目录不存在时自动创建。返回成功或结构化错误。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"content": {"description": "要写入的文件内容", "type": "string"}, "path": {"description": "要写入的文件路径", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["path", "content"], "type": "object"}, "name": "write_file"}, {"description": "对文件中的唯一匹配文本做精确替换。old_string 必须在文件中恰好出现一次，否则返回可区分错误。编辑前请先用 read_file 读取目标文件，确认 old_string 唯一。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"new_string": {"description": "替换后的新文本片段", "type": "string"}, "old_string": {"description": "文件中待替换的原文片段（需唯一匹配）", "type": "string"}, "path": {"description": "要编辑的文件路径", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["path", "old_string", "new_string"], "type": "object"}, "name": "edit_file"}, {"description": "在当前工作目录下执行 shell 命令，返回 stdout、stderr 和退出码。命令受超时约束（30s）。Windows 下使用 cmd /C，Linux/Mac 下使用 /bin/sh -c。读文件、找文件、搜内容请优先用 read_file/glob/grep，不要用 bash 拼凑。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"command": {"description": "要执行的 shell 命令", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["command"], "type": "object"}, "name": "bash"}, {"description": "按 glob 模式查找匹配的文件（不包含目录）。非递归：`*.py` 只匹配根目录下的 .py 文件。递归：`**/*.py` 匹配所有子目录中的 .py 文件。返回排序后的相对路径列表，最多 100 条。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"path": {"type": "string"}, "pattern": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["pattern"], "type": "object"}, "name": "glob"}, {"description": "在文件内容中按正则表达式搜索，返回匹配位置（文件名:行号:内容）。最多返回 100 条命中。", "input_schema": {"properties": {"glob": {"type": "string"}, "path": {"type": "string"}, "pattern": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["pattern"], "type": "object"}, "name": "grep"}], "session_id": "20261010-041212-bb22", "strategy": "compression-on-schema-progressive", "version": "0.1.32"}, "kind": "initial_state", "monotonic": 6323.332209487, "run_id": "tmux-s05", "schema_version": 1, "sequence": 4, "sha256": "8991e7864ff985228e8c0f93c7adf8d72e8ce1e314f00a063b8f8a5dd841a0e0", "utc": "2026-10-10T04:12:12.035174+00:00"}
